      RESIDUE| 		// the UI thread in a nested event loop - project.open never returns,
      RESIDUE| 		// and the client is told nothing (task #625).  The same report goes to
      RESIDUE| 		// stderr, and project.open hands the caller the per-item list.
      RESIDUE| 		if ( getGUI() != nullptr && !lmms::isUnattendedRun() )
      RESIDUE| 	// The project-scoped id counter, on the root element beside version /
      RESIDUE| 	// creatorversion (SPEC-stable-ids.md 3.2). The root is already a mutable
      RESIDUE| 	// document header: DataFile's constructor writes five sibling attributes
      RESIDUE| 	// there and DataFile::upgrade() rewrites them. This is the ONLY place ids
      RESIDUE| 	// reach the disk - load-time assignment is in memory only, which is what
      RESIDUE| 	// keeps the agent_surface gate's fixture byte-identical across a sweep.
      RESIDUE| 	dataFile.documentElement().setAttribute( "next-id", ProjectIds::next() );
